        "content": [
          "Deliver Me, O LORD!"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "hebrew_subtitle",
        "content": [
          "A Psalm of David, when he fled from his son Absalom."
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "line_break"
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 1,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "O LORD, how my foes have increased!",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "text": "How many rise up against me!",
            "poem": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 2,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Many say of me,",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "text": "“God will not deliver him.”",
            "poem": 2
          },
          "Selah",
          {
            "noteId": 5
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "footnotes": [
